 "appinfo.version": "Leagan",
 "plist.NSHealthShareUsageDescription": "Léann Liftr do mheáchan, comhdhéanamh coirp agus ráta croí chun do dhul chun cinn a thaispeáint.",
 "plist.NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription": "Sábhálann Liftr do sheisiúin ghiomnáisiam, calraí agus meáchan in Apple Health.",
 "plist.NSCameraUsageDescription": "Úsáideann Liftr an ceamara chun cód QR nó barrachód do phas giomnáisiam a scanadh.",
 "plist.NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription": "Léann Liftr cód do phas giomnáisiam ó ghabháil scáileáin a roghnaíonn tú.",
 "Edit text": "Cuir an téacs in eagar",
 "1M": "1M",
 "3M": "3M",
 "6M": "6M",
 "1Y": "1B",
 "No data in this period.": "Níl aon sonraí sa tréimhse seo.",
 "Min": "Íos",
 "Average": "Meán",
 "Max": "Uas",
 "Your data stays yours": "Is leatsa do chuid sonraí i gcónaí",
 "Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.": "Níl aon chuntas, aon fhreastalaí ná aon fhógraíocht ag Liftr. Stóráiltear do sheisiúin, do chleachtaí, do ghnáthaimh, do thomhais choirp agus do phas giomnáisiam ar do ghléas agus i do iCloud príobháideach féin.",
 "Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.": "Le do chead amháin, léann Liftr do mheáchan, do chomhdhéanamh coirp agus do ráta croí scíthe, agus sábhálann sé seisiúin, calraí, achar agus meáchan. Ní fhágann sonraí sláinte do ghléasanna trí Liftr riamh agus ní úsáidtear riamh iad le haghaidh fógraíochta. Is féidir leat an rochtain a athrú am ar bith san aip Health.",
 "iCloud": "iCloud",
 "Syncing between your iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch goes through your private iCloud database. The developer cannot see this data. The code of your gym pass is end-to-end encrypted.": "Téann an sioncronú idir do iPhone, iPad agus Apple Watch trí do bhunachar sonraí príobháideach iCloud. Ní féidir leis an bhforbróir na sonraí seo a fheiceáil. Tá cód do phas giomnáisiam criptithe ó cheann ceann.",
 "Camera and photos": "Ceamara agus grianghraif",
 "The camera and your photos are only used to read the code of your gym pass. Images are not saved or sent anywhere.": "Ní úsáidtear an ceamara ná do ghrianghraif ach chun cód do phas giomnáisiam a léamh. Ní shábháiltear íomhánna agus ní sheoltar áit ar bith iad.",
 "Notifications": "Fógraí",
 "Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.": "Pleanáiltear meabhrúcháin agus an t-amadóir scíthe ar do ghléas. Níl aon fhreastalaí brú ann.",
 "No tracking": "Gan rianú",
 "Liftr contains no analytics, no third-party code and no tracking of any kind.": "Níl aon anailísíocht, aon chód tríú páirtí ná rianú de chineál ar bith in Liftr.",
 "Deleting your data": "Do chuid sonraí a scriosadh",
 "Delete workouts in the app. To remove everything, delete Liftr and remove its data in Settings → your name → iCloud → Manage Storage.": "Scrios seisiúin san aip. Chun gach rud a bhaint, scrios Liftr agus bain a chuid sonraí i Socruithe → d'ainm → iCloud → Manage Storage.",
 "Privacy": "Príobháideacht",
 "Liftr is built to keep your training private.": "Tá Liftr déanta chun do thraenáil a choinneáil príobháideach.",
 "Questions?": "Ceisteanna?",
 "Last updated: November 2026": "Nuashonraithe go deireanach: Samhain 2026",
 "Waiting for internet": "Ag fanacht ar an idirlíon",
 "iCloud storage is full": "Tá stóras iCloud lán",
 "iCloud isn't set up yet": "Níl iCloud socraithe fós",
 "iCloud is busy. Liftr tries again automatically; your workouts are safe on this device.": "Tá iCloud gnóthach. Bainfidh Liftr triail eile as go huathoibríoch; tá do sheisiúin slán ar an ngléas seo.",
 "Your workouts sync as soon as you're online again.": "Sioncrónófar do sheisiúin a luaithe a bheidh tú ar líne arís.",
 "Free up space in iCloud to keep syncing. Your workouts are safe on this device.": "Saor spás in iCloud chun leanúint ar aghaidh ag sioncronú. Tá do sheisiúin slán ar an ngléas seo.",
 "This version of Liftr can't save to iCloud yet. Your workouts are safe on this device and sync once this is fixed.": "Ní féidir leis an leagan seo de Liftr sábháil in iCloud fós. Tá do sheisiúin slán ar an ngléas seo agus sioncrónófar iad nuair a bheidh sé seo réitithe.",
 "Liftr tries again later. Your workouts are safe on this device.": "Bainfidh Liftr triail eile as níos déanaí. Tá do sheisiúin slán ar an ngléas seo.",
